[{"id": "7b19604", "elType": "container", "settings": {"padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "50", "right": "0", "bottom": "50", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "flex_direction": "row", "flex_align_items": "stretch", "flex_gap": {"size": 10, "unit": "px", "column": "10", "row": "10", "isLinked": true}}, "elements": [{"id": "9d7bc66", "elType": "container", "settings": {"_column_size": 100, "width": {"size": null, "unit": "%"}, "content_width": "full"}, "elements": [{"id": "ae0e4e9", "elType": "widget", "settings": {"title": "¿POR QUÉ UN CORREO CORPORATIVO?", "align": "center", "typography_typography": "custom", "typography_font_family": "Lexend", "typography_font_size": {"unit": "px", "size": 40, "sizes": []}, "typography_font_weight": "700", "__globals__": {"title_color": "globals/colors?id=95d093f"}, "header_size": "h1"}, "elements": [], "widgetType": "heading"}, {"id": "9531e94", "elType": "container", "settings": {"structure": "20", "flex_direction": "row", "flex_align_items": "stretch", "flex_gap": {"size": 10, "unit": "px", "column": "10", "row": "10", "isLinked": true}, "content_width": "full"}, "elements": [{"id": "875c3d7", "elType": "container", "settings": {"_column_size": 50, "width": {"size": null, "unit": "%"}, "content_width": "full", "flex_justify_content": "center"}, "elements": [{"id": "a0322d6", "elType": "widget", "settings": {"image": {"url": "https://www.creativeweb.com.ec/wp-content/uploads/2017/08/MAILEMPRESARIAL.png", "id": 943, "alt": "correos corporativos empresarial", "source": "library", "size": ""}}, "elements": [], "widgetType": "image"}], "isInner": true}, {"id": "f2cc91a", "elType": "container", "settings": {"_column_size": 50, "width": {"size": null, "unit": "%"}, "content_width": "full"}, "elements": [{"id": "39d306d", "elType": "widget", "settings": {"title": "Potencia tu presencia empresarial con un correo corporativo de primer nivel. ", "typography_typography": "custom", "typography_font_family": "Lexend", "typography_font_size": {"unit": "px", "size": 30, "sizes": []}, "typography_font_weight": "700", "__globals__": {"title_color": "globals/colors?id=95d093f"}}, "elements": [], "widgetType": "heading"}, {"id": "f3706c7", "elType": "widget", "settings": {"width": {"unit": "%", "size": 20, "sizes": []}, "text": "Separador", "weight": {"unit": "px", "size": 2, "sizes": []}, "_margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "-15", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "__globals__": {"color": "globals/colors?id=e63e7a1"}}, "elements": [], "widgetType": "divider"}, {"id": "78b7fd6", "elType": "widget", "settings": {"editor": "<p>En el mundo digital de hoy, la primera impresión es fundamental. Con nuestros correos electrónicos empresariales personalizados y una página web profesional, su empresa proyectará una imagen de confianza y solidez desde el primer contacto.</p>\n<p>Establezca un canal de comunicación sólido con colaboradores, clientes y proveedores mediante direcciones de correo exclusivas que reflejen la identidad de su marca.</p>\n<p><strong>No se conforme con correos genéricos Hotmail o Gmail.</strong></p>\n<p>¡Conquiste el mercado y deje una huella duradera en la mente de sus clientes!</p>", "typography_typography": "custom", "typography_font_family": "Lexend", "typography_font_size": {"unit": "px", "size": 18, "sizes": []}, "typography_font_weight": "300"}, "elements": [], "widgetType": "text-editor"}], "isInner": true}], "isInner": true}], "isInner": true}], "isInner": false}, {"id": "aa16f23", "elType": "container", "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_gap": {"size": 0, "unit": "px", "column": "0", "row": "0", "isLinked": true}, "background_background": "classic", "background_overlay_background": "classic", "flex_direction": "row", "flex_align_items": "stretch", "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}}, "elements": [{"id": "3975dfa", "elType": "container", "settings": {"_column_size": 100, "width": {"size": null, "unit": "%"}, "content_width": "full", "flex_gap": {"unit": "px", "size": 0, "sizes": [], "column": "0", "row": "0", "isLinked": true}}, "elements": [{"id": "fbe105d", "elType": "widget", "settings": {"template_id": "2243"}, "elements": [], "widgetType": "template"}], "isInner": true}], "isInner": false}, {"id": "ee92e64", "elType": "container", "settings": {"padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "080", "right": "0", "bottom": "80", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "flex_direction": "row", "flex_align_items": "stretch", "flex_gap": {"size": 10, "unit": "px", "column": "10", "row": "10", "isLinked": true}}, "elements": [{"id": "d47a968", "elType": "container", "settings": {"_column_size": 100, "width": {"size": null, "unit": "%"}, "content_width": "full"}, "elements": [{"id": "e79945b", "elType": "widget", "settings": {"title": "Email Empresarial | Correos Corporativos<br> en Ecuador", "align": "center", "title_color": "#333333", "typography_typography": "custom", "typography_font_family": "Lexend", "typography_font_size": {"unit": "px", "size": 24, "sizes": []}, "typography_font_weight": "400"}, "elements": [], "widgetType": "heading"}, {"id": "e5bc2ba", "elType": "widget", "settings": {"editor": "Correos corporativos con dominio propio: comunicaciones seguras y personalizadas para empresas del Ecuador y todo el mundo. Potencie su eficiencia y alcance global.", "typography_typography": "custom", "typography_font_family": "Lexend", "typography_font_size": {"unit": "px", "size": 18, "sizes": []}, "typography_font_weight": "300"}, "elements": [], "widgetType": "text-editor"}, {"id": "26daac4", "elType": "container", "settings": {"structure": "30", "flex_direction": "row", "flex_align_items": "stretch", "flex_gap": {"size": 10, "unit": "px", "column": "10", "row": "10", "isLinked": true}, "content_width": "full"}, "elements": [{"id": "cd53c61", "elType": "container", "settings": {"_column_size": 33, "width": {"size": null, "unit": "%"}, "content_width": "full"}, "elements": [{"id": "897eacc", "elType": "widget", "settings": {"selected_icon": {"value": "far fa-envelope", "library": "fa-regular"}, "title_text": "Cuentas de correo corporativo y mucho más", "description_text": "", "text_align": "center", "title_color": "#333333", "title_typography_typography": "custom", "title_typography_font_family": "Lexend", "title_typography_font_size": {"unit": "px", "size": 24, "sizes": []}, "title_typography_font_weight": "400", "description_typography_typography": "custom", "description_typography_font_family": "Lexend", "description_typography_font_size": {"unit": "px", "size": 18, "sizes": []}, "description_typography_font_weight": "300", "__globals__": {"primary_color": "globals/colors?id=e63e7a1", "hover_primary_color": "globals/colors?id=52ec5e0"}, "hover_animation": "wobble-vertical"}, "elements": [], "widgetType": "icon-box"}, {"id": "52eb34c", "elType": "widget", "settings": {"editor": "<ul><li>Cuentas de correo electrónico IMAP - POP3 con SMTP</li><li>Certificado de seguridad SSL</li><li>Espacio ilimitado por cada cuenta de E-mail (PRO)</li></ul>", "typography_typography": "custom", "typography_font_family": "Lexend", "typography_font_size": {"unit": "px", "size": 18, "sizes": []}, "typography_font_weight": "300"}, "elements": [], "widgetType": "text-editor"}], "isInner": true}, {"id": "2e47851", "elType": "container", "settings": {"_column_size": 33, "width": {"size": null, "unit": "%"}, "content_width": "full"}, "elements": [{"id": "6682663", "elType": "widget", "settings": {"selected_icon": {"value": "fas fa-bug", "library": "fa-solid"}, "title_text": "Protección AntiVirus y Anti Spam", "description_text": "", "text_align": "center", "title_color": "#333333", "title_typography_typography": "custom", "title_typography_font_family": "Lexend", "title_typography_font_size": {"unit": "px", "size": 24, "sizes": []}, "title_typography_font_weight": "400", "description_typography_typography": "custom", "description_typography_font_family": "Lexend", "description_typography_font_size": {"unit": "px", "size": 18, "sizes": []}, "description_typography_font_weight": "300", "__globals__": {"primary_color": "globals/colors?id=e63e7a1", "hover_primary_color": "globals/colors?id=52ec5e0"}, "hover_animation": "wobble-vertical"}, "elements": [], "widgetType": "icon-box"}, {"id": "71d9dcc", "elType": "widget", "settings": {"editor": "<ul><li>Filtro anti-spam</li><li>Nuestra avanzada tecnología antivirus asegura que usted estará protegido de la descarga de malware y virus.</li></ul>", "typography_typography": "custom", "typography_font_family": "Lexend", "typography_font_size": {"unit": "px", "size": 18, "sizes": []}, "typography_font_weight": "300"}, "elements": [], "widgetType": "text-editor"}], "isInner": true}, {"id": "a8eb0f5", "elType": "container", "settings": {"_column_size": 33, "width": {"size": null, "unit": "%"}, "content_width": "full"}, "elements": [{"id": "2ebaf7e", "elType": "widget", "settings": {"selected_icon": {"value": "fas fa-tablet-alt", "library": "fa-solid"}, "title_text": "Soporte en todo tipo de dispositivos móviles", "description_text": "", "text_align": "center", "title_color": "#333333", "title_typography_typography": "custom", "title_typography_font_family": "Lexend", "title_typography_font_size": {"unit": "px", "size": 24, "sizes": []}, "title_typography_font_weight": "400", "description_typography_typography": "custom", "description_typography_font_family": "Lexend", "description_typography_font_size": {"unit": "px", "size": 18, "sizes": []}, "description_typography_font_weight": "300", "__globals__": {"primary_color": "globals/colors?id=e63e7a1", "hover_primary_color": "globals/colors?id=52ec5e0"}, "hover_animation": "wobble-vertical", "link": {"url": "https://www.creativeweb.com.ec/tutoriales/configurar-cuentas-de-correo-electronico-imap-o-pop3-en-celulares-android/", "is_external": "", "nofollow": "", "custom_attributes": ""}}, "elements": [], "widgetType": "icon-box"}, {"id": "8c2b1d7", "elType": "widget", "settings": {"editor": "<ul>\n<li>Compatible con Outlook y Thunderbird.</li>\n<li>Compatible con iPhone, Android, smartphone y tablet.</li>\n</ul>", "typography_typography": "custom", "typography_font_family": "Lexend", "typography_font_size": {"unit": "px", "size": 18, "sizes": []}, "typography_font_weight": "300"}, "elements": [], "widgetType": "text-editor"}], "isInner": true}], "isInner": true}, {"id": "3ce7c75", "elType": "container", "settings": {"structure": "30", "flex_direction": "row", "flex_align_items": "stretch", "flex_gap": {"size": 10, "unit": "px", "column": "10", "row": "10", "isLinked": true}, "content_width": "full"}, "elements": [{"id": "b301080", "elType": "container", "settings": {"_column_size": 33, "width": {"size": null, "unit": "%"}, "content_width": "full"}, "elements": [{"id": "e103a64", "elType": "widget", "settings": {"selected_icon": {"value": "far fa-thumbs-up", "library": "fa-regular"}, "title_text": "Compatibilidad Asegurada", "description_text": "", "text_align": "center", "title_color": "#333333", "title_typography_typography": "custom", "title_typography_font_family": "Lexend", "title_typography_font_size": {"unit": "px", "size": 24, "sizes": []}, "title_typography_font_weight": "400", "description_typography_typography": "custom", "description_typography_font_family": "Lexend", "description_typography_font_size": {"unit": "px", "size": 18, "sizes": []}, "description_typography_font_weight": "300", "__globals__": {"primary_color": "globals/colors?id=e63e7a1", "hover_primary_color": "globals/colors?id=52ec5e0"}, "hover_animation": "wobble-vertical", "link": {"url": "https://www.creativeweb.com.ec/tutoriales/configurar-cuentas-de-correo-electronico-imap-en-iphone/", "is_external": "", "nofollow": "", "custom_attributes": ""}}, "elements": [], "widgetType": "icon-box"}, {"id": "d052a7d", "elType": "widget", "settings": {"editor": "<ul><li>Usa cientos de clientes de correo sin problema.</li><li>Microsoft Outlook, Thunderbird, Evolution, Mail de Apple, etc.</li><li>Nuestro correo electrónico es 100% compatible con cualquier cliente que uses, en cualquier plataforma: Apple / Mac, Windows y Linux.</li></ul>", "typography_typography": "custom", "typography_font_family": "Lexend", "typography_font_size": {"unit": "px", "size": 18, "sizes": []}, "typography_font_weight": "300"}, "elements": [], "widgetType": "text-editor"}], "isInner": true}, {"id": "d75dafb", "elType": "container", "settings": {"_column_size": 33, "width": {"size": null, "unit": "%"}, "content_width": "full"}, "elements": [{"id": "6058d8c", "elType": "widget", "settings": {"selected_icon": {"value": "far fa-edit", "library": "fa-regular"}, "title_text": "Registro SPF + DKIM", "description_text": "", "text_align": "center", "title_color": "#333333", "title_typography_typography": "custom", "title_typography_font_family": "Lexend", "title_typography_font_size": {"unit": "px", "size": 24, "sizes": []}, "title_typography_font_weight": "400", "description_typography_typography": "custom", "description_typography_font_family": "Lexend", "description_typography_font_size": {"unit": "px", "size": 18, "sizes": []}, "description_typography_font_weight": "300", "__globals__": {"primary_color": "globals/colors?id=e63e7a1", "hover_primary_color": "globals/colors?id=52ec5e0"}, "hover_animation": "wobble-vertical"}, "elements": [], "widgetType": "icon-box"}, {"id": "5d7f3d7", "elType": "widget", "settings": {"editor": "<ul><li>Configuramos los registros SPF y DKIM de forma automática para que tu correo cumpla con todos los estándares necesarios para que lleguen a destino de forma correcta y que no sean rechazados por ningún proveedor como Gmail, Yahoo, Hotmail y demás.</li></ul>", "typography_typography": "custom", "typography_font_family": "Lexend", "typography_font_size": {"unit": "px", "size": 18, "sizes": []}, "typography_font_weight": "300"}, "elements": [], "widgetType": "text-editor"}], "isInner": true}, {"id": "e3fc167", "elType": "container", "settings": {"_column_size": 33, "width": {"size": null, "unit": "%"}, "content_width": "full"}, "elements": [{"id": "2aa3792", "elType": "widget", "settings": {"selected_icon": {"value": "fas fa-th", "library": "fa-solid"}, "title_text": "Panel de Administración cPanel en Español", "description_text": "", "text_align": "center", "title_color": "#333333", "title_typography_typography": "custom", "title_typography_font_family": "Lexend", "title_typography_font_size": {"unit": "px", "size": 24, "sizes": []}, "title_typography_font_weight": "400", "description_typography_typography": "custom", "description_typography_font_family": "Lexend", "description_typography_font_size": {"unit": "px", "size": 18, "sizes": []}, "description_typography_font_weight": "300", "__globals__": {"primary_color": "globals/colors?id=e63e7a1", "hover_primary_color": "globals/colors?id=52ec5e0"}, "hover_animation": "wobble-vertical"}, "elements": [], "widgetType": "icon-box"}, {"id": "3d70bde", "elType": "widget", "settings": {"editor": "<ul><li>Panel administrativo cPanel 100% en Español, totalmente intuitivo y fácil de usar para crear, eliminar y modificar casillas de correo electrónico, así como cambiar contraseñas de correo.</li><li>No necesitas ser programador o técnico, todo puede hacerse con un par de clicks, perfecto para cualquier empresa o negocio.</li></ul>", "typography_typography": "custom", "typography_font_family": "Lexend", "typography_font_size": {"unit": "px", "size": 18, "sizes": []}, "typography_font_weight": "300"}, "elements": [], "widgetType": "text-editor"}], "isInner": true}], "isInner": true}], "isInner": true}], "isInner": false}, {"id": "08551df", "elType": "container", "settings": {"content_width": "boxed", "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "40", "bottom": "40", "left": "20", "right": "20", "isLinked": false}}, "elements": [{"id": "1463cd1", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Cómo se crea una cuenta de correo corporativo", "header_size": "h2", "align": "left"}}, {"id": "003b0c9", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Se hace desde el panel de control, en menos de un minuto y sin ayuda de nadie. Estos son los pasos, por si quiere ver de qué se trata antes de contratar:</p><ol><li>Entrar a cPanel con los datos que le entregamos al activar su plan.</li><li>Abrir <strong>Cuentas de correo electrónico</strong> y pulsar <strong>Crear</strong>.</li><li>Escribir el nombre que va antes de la arroba —por ejemplo <em>ventas</em>— y elegir el dominio de su empresa.</li><li>Definir la contraseña y el espacio que tendrá esa casilla.</li><li>Crear. La cuenta queda lista para recibir correo de inmediato.</li></ol><p>Si prefiere no entrar al panel, las creamos nosotros y le entregamos los accesos.</p>"}}, {"id": "f7846e9", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Cómo leerlo desde donde ya trabaja", "header_size": "h2", "align": "left"}}, {"id": "c788190", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Su correo corporativo no lo obliga a cambiar de programa. Funciona en lo que ya usa:</p><ul><li><strong>Gmail</strong>: se agrega como cuenta externa y sigue usando la misma bandeja de entrada de siempre, pero enviando y recibiendo con su dominio.</li><li><strong>Outlook</strong>: se configura como cuenta IMAP y queda junto a sus otras cuentas.</li><li><strong>Celular</strong>, en Android o iPhone: se agrega en los ajustes de correo y llega la notificación como cualquier otro mensaje.</li><li><strong>Webmail</strong>: si prefiere no configurar nada, entra por el navegador desde cualquier computadora.</li></ul><p>Recomendamos <strong>IMAP y no POP3</strong>: con IMAP el correo queda en el servidor y lo ve igual desde el teléfono y desde la computadora. Con POP3 se descarga en un solo aparato y desaparece de los demás.</p>"}}, {"id": "e36a0e1", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Los cuatro errores que más vemos", "header_size": "h2", "align": "left"}}, {"id": "6e4f6cf", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<ul><li><strong>Usar POP3 por costumbre.</strong> Después el correo aparece en la computadora de la oficina y no en el celular, y nadie entiende por qué.</li><li><strong>Configurar el puerto sin cifrado.</strong> Si no se activa SSL, la contraseña viaja sin proteger. Los puertos correctos son 993 para recibir y 465 para enviar.</li><li><strong>Dejar el dominio sin registros SPF y DKIM.</strong> Sin eso, los correos que usted envía caen en la carpeta de spam del destinatario. Nosotros los dejamos configurados.</li><li><strong>Repartir la misma contraseña entre todos.</strong> Cuando alguien sale de la empresa hay que cambiarla en todas las casillas a la vez.</li></ul>"}}, {"id": "899d227", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Preguntas que nos hacen siempre", "header_size": "h2", "align": "left"}}, {"id": "97d20f4", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p><strong>¿Cuántas cuentas puedo tener?</strong><br>Depende del plan: desde 10 en el Inicial hasta sin límite en el Pymes. Las crea y las borra usted cuando quiera.</p><p><strong>¿Puedo pasar los correos que ya tengo?</strong><br>Sí. Migramos el historial de su proveedor actual sin que pierda mensajes ni contactos.</p><p><strong>¿Qué pasa si algún día me quiero ir?</strong><br>El dominio es suyo y los correos también. Se los entregamos y los lleva a donde quiera.</p><p><strong>¿Necesito tener página web?</strong><br>No. El correo corporativo funciona con solo tener el dominio, aunque la mayoría termina haciendo las dos cosas.</p><p><strong>¿Se puede desde el celular sin instalar nada?</strong><br>Sí, entrando por webmail desde el navegador.</p>"}}], "isInner": false}]